{"step_index":953,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T18:17:13Z","input_tokens":2245,"cache_read_tokens":103985,"output_tokens":1192,"content":"### Critical Invoice Extraction & Math Audit Fix Applied\n\nThe invoice extraction engine, comma/thousands-separator parser, garbage line-item filtering, and grand total extraction have been updated across the backend and client layers.\n\n---\n\n### 1. Updated Gemini Extraction Prompt\nThe extraction prompt in [server.py](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/server.py#L90-L135) and [utils/aiExtractor.js](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/utils/aiExtractor.js#L10-L45) was updated with the requested rules:\n- **Comma & Number Handling (Do Not Drop Digits):** Strictly treats commas as thousands separators (e.g. `'2,535.00'` $\\rightarrow$ `2535.0`, `'1,270.00'` $\\rightarrow$ `1270.0`). Prevents splitting or dropping digits before commas, cross-referencing against the printed amount in words.\n- **Genuine Line Items Only:** Extracts only tangible goods/services from the itemized table. Strips table borders, brackets (`[`, `|`, `]`), unit suffixes (`NOS`, `PCS`), and rejects rubber stamps, signatures, or scribbles (`©`, `~`, `|`).\n- **Printed Grand Total:** Extracts the actual printed total/net payable (`4,490.00`) instead of hallucinating by summing OCR misreads.\n- **Column Integrity:** Enforces proper Quantity (integer), Rate (unit price), and Billed Amount ($\\text{Qty} \\times \\text{Rate}$).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Post-Processing & Sanitization (`sanitize_and_clean_invoice`)\nImplemented in Python ([utils/clean_items.py](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/utils/clean_items.py#L83-L188) & [server.py](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/server.py#L151-L157)) and mirrored in JavaScript ([utils/itemCleaner.js](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/utils/itemCleaner.js#L106-L200)):\n1. **Supplier Name Cleanup:** Strips trailing OCR symbols (`|`, `[`, `]`, `()`, `&`, `0`).\n2. **Garbage Line Item Purge:**\n   - Strips leading/trailing OCR brackets and vertical pipes (`^[\\[\\|\\]\\(\\)\\s]+|[\\[\\|\\]\\(\\)\\s]+$`).\n   - Filters rows lacking at least 4 letters.\n   - Filters rows with $> 20\\%$ punctuation/stray symbols.\n   - Filters footer/stamp terms (`\"signature\"`, `\"authorised\"`, `\"terms\"`, `\"condition\"`, `\"bank details\"`).\n   - Strips commas from `quantity`, `unit_rate`, and `total_amount`.\n3. **Clean Numeric Parsing:** Parses and strips commas from `subtotal`, `cgst`, `sgst`, `igst`, and `declared_total`.\n4. **Active UI State Sync:** Applied to all Gemini outputs before updating the UI state in [app.js](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/app.js#L192-L215).\n\n---\n\n### 3. Verification Test Results\n\n```\nVendor:         Bosch Authorised Dealer (cleaned trailing '|[]')\nDeclared Total: 4490.0 (clean comma extraction from '4,490.00')\nItems Filtered: 2 items retained, 2 garbage lines purged\n  * Bosch All-in-One Metal Hand Tool Kit | Qty: 1.0 | Rate: 2535.0 | Total: 2535.0\n  * Taparia Universal Tool Kit           | Qty: 1.0 | Rate: 1270.0 | Total: 1270.0\nStatus:         All test assertions passed (Code 0)\n```\n\nThe FastAPI server is live and running at `http://localhost:3000`."}
